meta {
  name: 12. Unstage DataSet
  type: http
  seq: 35
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datasets/:id/unstage
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: {{sagaDataSetId}}
}

tests {
  test("Unstaged or already draft", function() {
    const status = res.getStatus();
    // 200=unstaged, 400=pending saga or already DRAFT
    expect(status === 200 || status === 400).to.be.true;
  });
}

docs {
  **Saga step 12 of 18** — Unstage the dataset before deleting it.

  Transitions the dataset from `READY` back to `DRAFT`. This must be called after the DATASET_DELETE saga from step 11 has completed. A 400 is returned if a saga is still pending or the dataset is already in `DRAFT`.

  **Precondition:** `sagaDataSetId` is set; dataset is in `READY` state (DATASET_DELETE saga has completed).

  **Expected Response:** 200 OK, body reflects dataset with status `DRAFT`. 400 if a saga is still pending or already `DRAFT`.

  **System Impact:**

  | Layer | Effect |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | DataSet status → `DRAFT` |
  | Config Adapter | — |
  | External System | — |
}
